+    To quantify temporal coherence for a time span $[t_1, t_2]$, treat each voxel as an independent variable [S1, unofficial]. Compute the standard deviation of each voxel over the time span, then average these values [S1, unofficial]. Let $s(v_i)$ be the standard deviation of voxel $v_i$ in the time span $[t_1, t_2]$, and $n$ be the number of voxels within the subvolume [S1, unofficial].
     $$ s(v_i) = \sqrt{\frac{1}{t_2 - t_1 + 1} \sum_{t=t_1}^{t_2} (v_{i,t} - \bar{v}_i)^2} $$
     $$ \text{Temporal Coherence} = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^{n} s(v_i) $$
